-  "advancements.interstice.master.description": "Master return travel, portals, tides, safe food, ruin surveying, native hunters and riftsteel equipment.",
-  "journal.interstice.overview": "INTERSTICE\nField journal\n\nTrials: %s/%s\n\nOpen Advancements → Interstice. This book explains the route and lists your own milestones. Reopen it to refresh progress.",
-  "journal.interstice.arrival": "1. A way back\n\nRemember the glowing node under the arrival roof. Use it to return to your entry point. Keep it intact and learn the return route before exploring.",
-  "journal.interstice.shelter": "2. The tide\n\nCraft a tide indicator; pressure couplers can be found in ruins. Seek a solid roof when warned. To pass the trial, shelter through the last 10 seconds of surge until ebb.",
-  "journal.interstice.silver": "3. Riftsilver\n\nMine and smelt the ore. Native planks make sticks. Craft a silver pickaxe, sword and armour. Ordinary armour does not stop native spider bites or spit.",
-  "journal.interstice.portal": "4. Stable portal\n\nBuild a 4×5 rift frame with an empty 2×3 opening. Corners are optional. Use a rift lens on the frame, then stand inside for 2 seconds. Find both recipes in JEI.",
-  "journal.interstice.chemistry": "5. Field chemistry\n\nUse the retort's recipe library. Pure lining: 2 vitriolite shards + pyrolith. Sorbent: umbral coal + aerolite. Supply reagents and fuel. Purify food with sorbent.",
-  "journal.interstice.equipment": "6. Expedition\n\nWear a field backpack in the Back slot. Use a structure surveyor to find ruins and route beacons to mark your way. Coating and ballast help but wear out.",
-  "journal.interstice.hunting": "7. Native hunters\n\nSpiders: skirmisher, lurker and spitter. Use distance and cover. The vault hunter tracks by sight. Ghast shots are fast; beware phantom grabs before the tide.",
-  "journal.interstice.steel": "8. Riftsteel\n\nRetort: 4 riftsilver ingots, 2 pyrolith, 2 pure linings and 2 chemotrophic fabrics. After 60 seconds of reaction, receive 4 ingots. Supply fuel and free output space.",
-  "journal.interstice.armour": "9. Armor\n\nSilver: exploration.\nSteel: heavy combat.\nMagen: power armor.\n\nEnchanting and anvils\nremain available.\n\nField power in Interstice.\nStored charge abroad.",
-  "journal.interstice.completion": "10. At home between seas\n\nMaster portals, tides and chemistry, survey ruins, defeat hunters and forge riftsteel. Trials reward experience. They do not lock recipes or remove existing progress.",
-  "journal.interstice.checklist": "Your trials",
